    <string name="about_description">Reminders By Valamas plays a short chime at scheduled times - no popups, no banners, no distractions.\n\nSet one-time, daily, or custom-day reminders, or use countdown mode for quick timers.\n\nWorks reliably on silent and vibrate, during calls, over media, and after device reboot.</string>

